      "title": "Nepal flash flood: India sends tunnel rescue team to Nepal",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/nepal-flash-flood-india-sends-tunnel-rescue-team-to-nepal/article71405468.ece",
      "description": "The MEA says at least 287 Indians remain missing as on Saturday, August 29, and in addition, 128 persons of Indian origin are also missing following the disaster",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
      "published": "2026-08-29T18:03:17"
